msgid ""
"<b>Allow unsolvable games</b><p>If checked, you run the risk of being "
"presented with games that are impossible to solve.</p><p>Note: Even if not "
"checked, you will fail to complete a game if you remove the tiles in the "
"wrong order!</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Permitir partidas sen solución</b>:<p>Se sinala esta opción, correrá o "
"risco que xogar partidas que son imposíbeis de resolver.</p> <p>Nota: Mesmo "
"se non a sinala, non poderá completar a partida se elimina as pezas na orden "
"incorrecta!</p>"

